' orders: the Report Designer's sample program (RD8). frmView, designed in tkEdit's Form Designer,
' holds a ReportViewer whose report is rptOrders, designed in its Report Designer: orders and their
' lines from Array( of T ) (master-detail), sorted, a parameter strip (MinQty, Heading, HideBlake)
' with Run, Print and PDF in the viewer's toolbar. The selftest drives the same reports, and rptMixed
' (SQLite, a DataGrid, a host source).
#import "vendor/tkControls/tkApp"
#import "./frmView"
using tkApp

dim as TKAPP_OPTIONS options
if tkApp_Init( options ) = false then end 1
dim as frmView.Form mainForm
mainForm.Build( )
mainForm.rvOrdersReport.ShowIn( mainForm.rvOrders.Handle )
end tkApp_Run( mainForm.Handle )
